            "text": "<strong>Refund Policy</strong>",
            "heading_tag": "h1"
          }
        },
        "richtext_3DXwML": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>We want you to be completely satisfied with your purchase.<br/><br/>If you encounter any issues with your order and wish to refund your item(s), please review our returns policy below.</p><p>____________________________</p><p><strong>Returns Window: </strong>Within 14 days of receiving the item.<br/></p><p><strong>Eligibility Criteria: </strong>Item(s) must be unworn, unused, and in its original packaging.<br/></p><p><strong>Defects & Incorrect Orders: </strong>We will replace your item free of charge or offer a full store credit refund if: a) You received a defective item (major defects e.g. tears, rips, large stains). b) You received the wrong size or a completely different item than ordered.<br/><br/>If the style is in stock, we will send a replacement at no extra cost. If it is out of stock, you may keep the original item and we will issue a full store credit refund.<br/><br/>Minor imperfections such as small loose stitches, difference in wash shades or faint marks are not considered major defects.</p><p><strong>Returns for Sizing Issues: </strong>If your item doesn’t fit, we now accept returns for size-related reasons. Vescartes does not cover the return shipping cost for sizing-related returns — this is the customer’s responsibility. All sizing returns must be sent via , and the tracking must show the parcel as delivered before a refund is processed.<br/><br/><strong>How to Return a Sizing Issue Item: </strong>1. Contact us via the contact form on our website or Instagram DM to request a return. 2. We will confirm the warehouse location to return your item to (this may vary depending on space availability). 3. Place a note with your order number inside the parcel. 4. Ship the parcel via tracked postage and keep your tracking information until the refund is processed. <br/></p><p><strong>Return Shipping: </strong>Customers are responsible for return shipping costs unless the return is due to a major defect, incorrect size sent, or incorrect item received.</p><p><strong>Refund Process: </strong>Refunds will be processed once the return is delivered and inspected. Please allow  after approval for the refund to reflect in your account.</p><p><br/>____________________________</p><p>We appreciate your understanding and support. This policy is designed to make returns fair, transparent, and more flexible for our customers while keeping our limited-run production model sustainable.</p><p>If you have any further questions, our customer support team is here to help.</p><p></p><p></p>"
          }
        }
      },
