        "text_YgRPRj": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Terms Of Service",
            "heading_alignment": "center",
            "underline_heading": true,
            "text": "<p>By purchasing from VESCARTES, you agree to the following terms.</p><p><strong>1. GENERAL</strong><br/><br/>Refunds may be issued for eligible returns, faulty items, or incorrect items.</p><p>All refund requests are subject to review once the item has been received and inspected.</p><p><strong>2. PRODUCTS</strong><br/><br/>All products are subject to availability. We reserve the right to limit quantities or discontinue items at any time.<br/><br/>Due to the nature of our garments, slight variations in colour, embroidery, or finish may occur and are not considered defects.</p><p><strong>3. PRICING & PAYMENTS</strong><br/><br/>All prices are listed in your selected currency and are subject to change without notice.<br/><br/>Payment must be completed at checkout. Orders will not be processed until payment is received.</p><p><strong>4. SHIPPING</strong><br/><br/>Orders are dispatched on the next working day. Delivery times may vary depending on location.<br/><br/>We are not responsible for delays caused by couriers, customs, or unforeseen circumstances.</p><p><strong>5. TRACKING</strong><br/><br/>Once your order has been dispatched, you will receive a tracking number via email. It is the customer’s responsibility to monitor shipment progress.</p><p><strong>6. DUTIES & TAXES</strong><br/><br/>All duties and taxes are covered by VESCARTES unless stated otherwise.</p><p><strong>7. RETURNS & EXCHANGES</strong><br/><br/>We accept returns within 14 days of delivery. Items must be unworn, unused, and in original packaging.<br/><br/>Customers are responsible for return shipping costs unless the item is faulty or incorrect.</p><p><strong>8. FAULTY ITEMS</strong><br/><br/>Major defects (such as tears, significant damage, or incorrect items) will be replaced or refunded.<br/><br/>Minor imperfections, including loose threads or slight variations, are not considered defects.</p><p>Size charts allow a 5% measurement leniency due to slight production variations.</p><p><strong>9. ORDER ACCURACY<br/></strong><br/>Customers are responsible for ensuring all order details, including sizing and shipping information, are correct at checkout. Amendments can be made up until dispatch; once an order has been dispatched, no changes can be made.</p><p><strong>10. LIABILITY<br/></strong><br/>We are not liable for any indirect or consequential damages resulting from the use of our products or website.</p><p><strong>11. INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY</strong><br/><br/>All content, designs, and artwork are the property of VESCARTES and may not be reproduced or used without permission.</p><p><strong>12. CONTACT</strong><br/><br/>For any questions, please contact: contact@vescartes.com</p><p></p>",
